WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,400
That's all, as long as he can regain his vitality, let alone the merchant girl, I will admit that he is just a beggar.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:11,580
Okay, I will send a message to your father and ask him to come to propose marriage in person when he comes back.

3
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:17,360
There is no need to wait for my father. I will propose marriage in the last two days.

4
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:23,360
Why, I'm afraid I'll be robbed if I go late, and there are still people who dare to rob people from our Pingninghou Mansion.

5
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:27,020
He originally went to see a civil servant named Xu, and he recognized me by mistake.

6
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:30,220
Son, is this considered marriage fraud?

7
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,620
The son did not say that he was the son of the Xu family

8
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:37,140
Besides, my son doesn’t think that Mr. Xu can compare to me.

9
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:43,410
Okay, I'll invite the best Huamei people in Chang'an to see you off tomorrow

10
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:47,210
Mother, just sit down, otherwise it will be too obvious and attract attention for nothing.

11
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:52,010
Okay, okay, I'm sitting

12
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:56,510
No, I'm sitting here feeling panicked. I'm going to pick out two drawing books for Brother Cheng to cover him up.

13
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:59,710
Brother Cheng is only two years old, how can he read a drawing book?

14
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:05,790
Sitting here at night, I don’t know which day is stupid.

15
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:11,870
If you steal a horse, just kick it in the leg

16
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:16,820
Xiu Wenxiong, why are you late today? Why are your legs like this?

17
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:19,020
I accidentally sprained my ankle yesterday. It's okay.

18
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:32,700
This is what Ayu said about looking extremely good

19
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:35,500
My little sister’s vision is really unique
